          "explanation": "The family converted the simplified instructions into a visible home plan, showing trajectory impact.",
          "quote": "抄纸上贴药盒旁边"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly translated complex post-stroke, insulin, and medication issues into plain caregiver language and the family implemented the written home plan. This is beyond generic politeness and had meaningful trajectory impact.",
