          "quote": "以前治类风湿的药名"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00048",
          "explanation": "The family then disclosed the specific old medication names.",
          "quote": "甲氨蝶呤片”“雷公藤多苷片”“柳氮磺吡啶肠溶片"
        }
