        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly adapted the plan to the caregiver’s burden and real-world logistics: separate old drugs, label them, record only a few key items, and use pharmacy/neuro clinic as near-term safety checks. This had meaningful impact, as the family arrived for in-person reconciliation with the requested materials.",
